---
// The layers of a card's finish, under its words: base, sheen, sparkle, tooth. The glare goes on
// top, so the card that uses these ends with `<span class="mcard-glare" />`.
---

<span class="mcard-base"></span>
<span class="mcard-sheen"></span>
<span class="mcard-spark"></span>
<span class="mcard-tooth"></span>
